#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1073-A expect=violation domain=TR
#note "The OTHER THREE prohibited qualifiers (TRLAT, TRDIR, TRPORTOT) present, deliberately NO TRLOC. Predicted VIOLATION with count EXACTLY 1, NOT 3: the whole four-way or-tree is a single dataset-level constant (BroadcastFold), so three matching disjuncts still yield one finding. Pins disjuncts 2-4, which the twin leaves entirely untested, and pins the count semantics at the same time."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TR label="Tumor Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRSEQ    type=Num
col TRTESTCD type=Char
col TRLAT    type=Char label="Laterality"
col TRDIR    type=Char label="Directionality"
col TRPORTOT type=Char label="Portion or Totality"
---
S1 | TR | 001 | 1 | LDIAM | LEFT | PROXIMAL | ENTIRE
---
